 Oct 12, the Burke County record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025, November to December came in at 43% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 38% of normal there. Grid 18795 had its driest year in 2007 at 58%.</p>"}
